{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The officially licensed digital adaptation of board game K2 with Spiel des Jahres Kennerspiel Nominee and Golden Geek Best Family Board Game Nominee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/b0da819dcb8f0a570b5349cff7bc1109.avif?t=1763553739\" width=608 height=116 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/4b9a81c0d0f869c123adfc0bd265214f.poster.avif?t=1763553739\" width=606 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/4b9a81c0d0f869c123adfc0bd265214f.webm?t=1763553739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/4b9a81c0d0f869c123adfc0bd265214f.mp4?t=1763553739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/2d61b7fcadb9fd31eb4a9b3ee7549106.avif?t=1763553739\" width=608 height=79 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/23368fa2fc918584e0b696e9aa26cb49.poster.avif?t=1763553739\" width=606 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/23368fa2fc918584e0b696e9aa26cb49.webm?t=1763553739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/23368fa2fc918584e0b696e9aa26cb49.mp4?t=1763553739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compete against artificial intelligence with 3 levels of difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play single player mode to beat your own results</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beat friends online via multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Short single-player campaign </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/5baeb24ddc40c29dfdb94a724418bbcd.avif?t=1763553739\" width=608 height=79 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/983f5b7c362843fd7410dc8f0e228dfd.poster.avif?t=1763553739\" width=606 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/983f5b7c362843fd7410dc8f0e228dfd.webm?t=1763553739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take into account current weather conditions, chosen route topography and opponents\u2019 moves. Decide when and if your climbers push the summit, find strategy places for camps. Use the full potential of your cards. Take turns carefully. Extra maps and missions have rules twists. Find out what is important on each map or mission and modify your plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a climbing simulator. You become a head of the expedition. Take responsibility for your choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/506e7c4c6ccee9f377f346598c275397.avif?t=1763553739\" width=608 height=79 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/17c67f96acf5d0169a05d6197cda7184.avif?t=1763553739\" width=602 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a known board game. Find out why reprints were needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes all official expansions</strong>. Experience a variety of maps and challenges on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K2,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount Everest,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lhotse,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broad Peak,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >plus a bonus story campaign created especially for the digital version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/ba836a8e6b2861251ae591014516b9ec.avif?t=1763553739\" width=608 height=116 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/5cc8b347527926fb022d2a1e5b4b879d.avif?t=1763553739\" width=602 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what the high mountain expedition really looks like. How heavy are climbers boots? How to make a fire if the lighter does not work? Unlock facts and climbers stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/0ed6e1f259ca4b35f842d0a3af26663f.avif?t=1763553739\" width=608 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord or wishlist on Steam. Be informed about our roadmap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need your help to vote for UX solutions or ideas for new campaign missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561310/extras/b55fec17aac58d0f54366070e33b04b8.avif?t=1763553739\" width=608 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a tiny indie game studio. Programmer and UI/UX designer joined forces to deliver high mountain experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to leave any good feedback or critical suggestion at Community Center.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Why is K2 called K2?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/7addae68f94921c48f59c95b4d99f3094e32c2c6.jpg"},{"name":"The last winter bastion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/dd7e336154bcd18885f894aeebac699433e47303.jpg"},{"name":"Broad Peak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/c42b72fc20e091447647cf90ad12ac6059aee742.jpg"},{"name":"Is Broad Peak really broad?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/f12a1582562057e4cd81c2d3513432d25a939791.jpg"},{"name":"Lhotse: The South Face","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/6796c367542905610c45afa87c044bca6325173a.jpg"},{"name":"Lhotse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/16ec273c43e331fd5e579b6b059c9ac7978f5563.jpg"},{"name":"How high is the world?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/f552e80dde9339df66584b95afefeb0ff76f96f9.jpg"},{"name":"How many people reach Mount Everest daily?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/a7370bc3573a52daa486a2240501d8881a65143a.jpg"},{"name":"Eight-thousanders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2561310/0c84c1c3b8d64f88dc4cf3d2d85819970d18d7e2.jpg"},{"name":"How long to the top?","path":"htt